This repository is published for review.

It holds two things, and NOTICE in this directory says which files are
which. The first is the site generator, its checks, the chrome templates,
the stylesheet and script, the deploy workflow and the runbooks. The second
is the copy, the structured data, the images, the declared business values
and the founder's identity that make this Tectori's website. The second is
not licensed under any terms. The trademarks, the account identifiers and
the founder's identity are set out in NOTICE and no permission below reaches
them.

